  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Sometimes a friend walks past you as you're going through your menu and you accidentally unfriend them or block them (unknowingly). Then you log on the next day and wonder why they're never online anymore and finally you're like \"Oh\". If the game needs to ask you if you're SURE about asking someone for an invite, it would be nice if we could be sure about blocking or unfriending somebody since it's so easy to misclick.",
